OL,3,GNEWSAPavement parking slammed by
OL,4,Awheelchair user
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she is "almost every day"
OL,7,Fforced to take her wheelchair on to
OL,8,Fbusy roads because of the amount of
OL,9,Fcars parking on pavement where she
OL,10,Flives.
OL,12,FCaroline Lewis from Market Drayton in
OL,13,FShropshire said "people don't care
OL,14,Fanymore" about how and where they
OL,15,Fpark".
OL,17,FIt is not illegal to park on pavement
OL,18,Fin the county, but there can be hefty
OL,19,Ffines for those blocking the public's
OL,20,Fpath.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
